Dr Kawashima’s Brain Training Switch Review:
Calculate your overall Brain Age Score by performing a series of back-to-back exercises that challenge your information processing speed, short-term memory and self-control. You can also compare Brain Age Scores with friends and family too. 
In this video I took on Ana in a head to head challenge of Birdwatching, Flag Raising and Box counting to see who can think faster and has the better memory.

"Should I buy Dr Kawashima’s Brain Training on Switch?"
Dr Kawashima’s Brain Training on Switch is a fun interactive way of training your brain to become smarter. You challenge your brain with a range of classic and new exercises! We both found this game to be fun. In my opinion if school was this interactive and fun more kids would enjoy learning.
The only downside I found was the fact that you cannot have your Switch docked in order to do the Daily training, you can only participate in the daily training in handheld mode.
 

My Dr Kawashima’s Brain Training Switch rating: 7/10
Dr Kawashima’s Brain Training Switch Price: £24.29
Dr Kawashima’s Brain Training Switch Release Date: 3/01/2020
Dr Kawashima’s Brain Training Switch No. of Players: up to 2 players
Dr Kawashima’s Brain Training Switch File Size: 318 MB
Dr Kawashima’s Brain Training Switch Category: Lifestyle, Health & Fitness

